"><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>t</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><msup><mi>s</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msup><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>d</mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>.</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></li>\n<li><p>Integral II does <em>not</em> match the definition. The integrand <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"26\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D467 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D452 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-texatom></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> is not equivalent to that shown in the definition.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>Integral III does <em>not</em> match the definition. The lower bound of integration does not match that given in the definition. </p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\"</p>\n</div>",
